  "reviewed_contract": [
    "Exact bytes plus repeated query/form values go into declared message_parser, source query selection last-value semantics; no raw API_TOKEN/PORT exposure.",
    "process validates ordinary parsed identity and username fallback, Unicode strip, preserved channel/source and message/reply coordinates.",
    "Plugin input first, then ordinary user DB history, start processing status, second input check, registered command or user.message, finish status; plugin callback remains message.action.",
    "MessageHelper.put(role=user) has no extra source SSE effect; source MessageOper.add maps existing encrypted history. Callback skips user history.",
    "Only unsupported model-specific path is removed: Agent/LLM transcription, agent choice/state and reserved /ai or /noai handling. Raw slash strings use the ordinary registry unchanged; images/audio/files still prevent text input consumption.",
    "Source site/subscription/media/transfer interactive assistants are separate business systems outside this bridge; registered ordinary plugin commands/callbacks remain.",
    "Accepted is nondurable background admission, not parser success. SDK own object lease cancels/joins on stop; stale producer rejected and parser error posts safe ordinary system.error without raw message body."
  ],
